WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.568
- To anyone who says I'm too
young or girls can't do it,

00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:07.243
I would say, "Come watch
a Monster Jam event.

00:00:07.243 --> 00:00:09.283
"Watch me compete and watch me win."

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:12.116
(energetic music)

00:00:15.863 --> 00:00:17.731
I'm Rosalee Ramer, the world's youngest

00:00:17.731 --> 00:00:21.069
professional female monster truck driver.

00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:24.780
When I first sat in the seat
of a monster truck, I was 11.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.544
I started competing at age 14,

00:00:27.544 --> 00:00:30.285
and I've been competing ever since.

00:00:30.285 --> 00:00:31.821
I could drive a monster truck

00:00:31.821 --> 00:00:35.875
before I could drive a car on the road.

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.435
I'm studying mechanical
engineering at Georgia Tech,

00:00:38.435 --> 00:00:41.315
and I'm working on making the
monster truck of my dreams.

00:00:41.315 --> 00:00:43.331
I'm working on lowering
the center of gravity

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:45.731
of the monster truck so
that it has better handling

00:00:45.731 --> 00:00:47.378
and more capabilities when we're out there

00:00:47.378 --> 00:00:49.339
on the field competing.

00:00:49.339 --> 00:00:50.856
First I get an idea about

00:00:50.856 --> 00:00:53.203
how I wanna improve a monster truck.

00:00:53.203 --> 00:00:56.371
Then I put some of my ideas
down on paper in my sketch pad.

00:00:56.371 --> 00:00:58.278
I get to put that into the computer

00:00:58.278 --> 00:01:00.157
so I can work with it on a higher level,

00:01:00.157 --> 00:01:02.653
and I get to 3-D print it.

00:01:02.653 --> 00:01:04.230
Having a technical mind is definitely

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.565
an advantage on the field.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.400
I know exactly how my truck works,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.927
and it allows me to read
how it's doing on the track.

00:01:10.927 --> 00:01:13.894
I can fix anything that's
wrong with my truck.

00:01:13.894 --> 00:01:16.678
Wild Flower is the first
truck I got to help build.

00:01:16.678 --> 00:01:20.326
Putting that pink, those
big flowers on my truck,

00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:24.347
that really shows who I
am, and I'm proud of that.

00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:26.363
And I hope that that makes little girls

00:01:26.363 --> 00:01:28.902
who do love princesses
and who do love flowers

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:32.934
more open-minded to the world
of big trucks and machinery

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.184
and mechanical engineering.

00:01:36.176 --> 00:01:38.011
I'm proud of who I am.

00:01:38.011 --> 00:01:40.677
I am a woman, I drive big trucks.

00:01:40.677 --> 00:01:43.594
(energetic music)

